# Astro generated types and caches
.astro/

# Collected data stays local by default.
data/*
# The event's companies are public information and the same for everyone, so they are shared.
!data/companies.json
# So is the list of public portfolio addresses the test applicants are collected from.
!data/seeds.json
# And what was read from them, so a fresh clone shows the same applicants without spending
# Context.dev credits. `scripts/collect.ts` adds to it as before.
!data/applicants.json

# The root .gitignore excludes every .env file; the example with empty values is committed.
!.env.example
